flowchart LR
    accTitle: GTA component ownership and dependency boundaries
    accDescr: Shared Core is owned by private Workshop, public Phone uses a reviewed sync, SP-RP consumes private native components, Upstate uses external re3 and local assets, and mod implementations stay private while generated research and guides remain public. Arrows show dependency direction, not task order.
    subgraph SHARED["PRIVATE WORKSHOP — shared and native source"]
        CORE["Valkyrie Core\nShared SA support and hooks\nOne private source owner"]:::private
        SUITE["Private SA suite\nAtmosphere / Fuel / Radar / Realworld\nBlips / animations / overlay / RPC\nDiagnostics / stats"]:::private
        TRAINER["Trainer / flight controls / game-sa\nStandalone helpers and compatibility layer\nHistorical target evidence needs recheck"]:::private
        NATIVE["Native server components\nsprp-ai / sprp-async / sprp-ssmp\nSeparate host and protocol contracts"]:::private
        UPSTATE["Upstate/re3 compatibility port\nOwned patch + pause-map tools\nCLEO Redux travel script"]:::private
        ASSET["Model / vehicle / animation / map tools\nAuthoring source stays with owner\nImported game payloads stay local"]:::private
    end
    subgraph PUBLIC["MOD IMPLEMENTATION — PRIVATE EXCEPT PHONE"]
        DOC["Doctor + Crashfix\nONE x86 ASI / no artwork\nPrivate source + combined notices"]:::private
        MAP["Valkyrie Map\nHistorical public baseline archived privately\nExact later source remains a gap"]:::private
        REPAIR["Repair\nC# utility embeds combined ASI\nIsolated self-tests"]:::private
        PHONE["Public Phone\nReviewed embedded trainer/map scope\nPrivate sync requires review"]:::public
        BASE["Shared baseline and preserved source\nPrivate Workshop ownership\nPhone export remains a separate reviewed scope"]:::private
    end
    SRG["Private SRG / GTA Midnight\nSA conversion and runtime\nConsumes Workshop Core"]:::private
    SERVER["Private SP-RP gamemode\nConsumes native server components\nAccounts and operations stay private"]:::private
    WEB["Private website/UCP + bot/live\nSupporting server services\nSeparate publishing branches/processes"]:::private
    LAUNCH["Private GTA Launcher integration\nOrchestrates owner-side server workflow\nRelease record is not public download availability"]:::private
    DLSS["Private GTA rendering integration\nHost / driver / per-game profile checks\nSeparate graphics experimentation"]:::private
    RE3["Public third-party novawish/re3\nExact patch target revision\nExternal engine source owner"]:::reference
    INPUTS["Local / restricted prerequisites\nLicensed game install / assets / SDKs\nNo payload export through this graph"]:::blocked
    SYNC{"Reviewed Phone sync\nScope + source diff + notices + checks"}:::gate
    SUITE -->|"Depends on"| CORE
    TRAINER -->|"Shared support where used"| CORE
    SRG -->|"Source dependency"| CORE
    SRG -->|"Authoring workflow"| ASSET
    SERVER -->|"Consumes"| NATIVE
    WEB -. "Service integration" .-> SERVER
    LAUNCH -. "Orchestration" .-> SERVER
    UPSTATE -->|"Patch applies to"| RE3
    UPSTATE -->|"Owner-supplied assets"| INPUTS
    ASSET -->|"Owner-supplied input"| INPUTS
    DLSS -->|"Host and game prerequisites"| INPUTS
    PHONE -->|"Reviewed dependency updates"| SYNC
    SYNC -->|"Private authoring owner"| CORE
    SYNC -->|"Trainer authoring owner"| TRAINER
    DOC -->|"Shared private source"| CORE
    MAP -->|"Shared private source"| CORE
    REPAIR -->|"Builds and embeds"| DOC
    classDef public fill:#dcf5e7,stroke:#23724d,color:#123b29;
    classDef private fill:#ede3fa,stroke:#77519a,color:#39234c;
    classDef reference fill:#d9f4f4,stroke:#267b80,color:#153e42;
    classDef gate fill:#fff0ca,stroke:#9a6a16,color:#543b0e;
    classDef blocked fill:#ffe2df,stroke:#a74d46,color:#59251f;
    style SHARED fill:#faf6fe,stroke:#c4addb,color:#39234c
    style PUBLIC fill:#faf6fe,stroke:#c4addb,color:#39234c
